SUMMARY:The President's Cake | Arthouse Now
DESCRIPTION:While people struggle daily to survive under sanctions in Sad
 dam's Iraq\, nine-year-old Lamia must use her wits to gather ingredients 
 for the mandatory cake to celebrate President Saddam Hussein's birthday o
 r face the consequences—prison or death. A touching coming-of-age tale 
 that combines empathy\, pragmatism\, universally relatable characters\, a
 nd striking cinematography. [105 min\; drama\; Arabic with English subtit
 les]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  While people struggle daily to survive 
 under sanctions in Saddam's Iraq\, nine-year-old Lamia must use her wits 
 to gather ingredients for the mandatory cake to celebrate President Sadda
 m Hussein's birthday or face the consequences—prison or death. A touchi
 ng coming-of-age tale that combines empathy\, pragmatism\, universally re
 latable characters\, and striking cinematography. [105 min\; drama\; Arab
 ic with English subtitles]</p>
