SUMMARY:Grave of the Fireflies | The Long Revolution
DESCRIPTION:After their mother dies in a World War II air raid\, a young 
 brother and sister in Japan struggle to survive and protect one another i
 n an abandoned shelter. Considered one of the greatest animated films mad
 e to date and a masterwork of Japanese animation\, the film is renowned f
 or its deep empathy for its child protagonists\, its emotional weight\, a
 nd its forceful anti-war reception. [88 min\; drama\; Japanese with Engli
 sh subtitles]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  After their mother dies in a World War 
 II air raid\, a young brother and sister in Japan struggle to survive and
  protect one another in an abandoned shelter. Considered one of the great
 est animated films made to date and a masterwork of Japanese animation\, 
 the film is renowned for its deep empathy for its child protagonists\, it
 s emotional weight\, and its forceful anti-war reception. [88 min\; drama
 \; Japanese with English subtitles]</p>
