SUMMARY:No No Nooky T.V. + Nitrate Kisses | Underground Film Series
DESCRIPTION:No No Nooky T.V.(1987):No No Nooky T.V. confronts the feminis
 t controversy around sexuality with electronic language\, pixels\, and in
 terface. Even the monitor is eroticized in this film/video hybrid that po
 ints fun at romance\, sexuality\, and love in our post-industrial age. [1
 2 min\; experimental\; English]Nitrate Kisses(1992): Barbara Hammer's doc
 umentary Nitrate Kisses confronts the historical erasure of queer sexuali
 ty through the frank embrace of sex as an act that is both liberating and
  political. [67 min\; English]
