SUMMARY:The Wages of Fear | Re:Made
DESCRIPTION:In a downtrodden South American oil town\, four desperate men
  sign on for a suicide mission: driving trucks packed with nitroglycerin 
 over makeshift roads and treacherous mountain terrain. The men are forced
  to navigate fires\, bumps\, and jolts\, while their fortitude and friend
 ship are put to the ultimate test: keep cool or die. The Wages of Fear is
 \, hands down\, one of the greatest thrillers of all time and a white-knu
 ckle ride from Clouzot\, France's legendary master of suspense. [152 min\
 ; suspense\, thriller\; French with English subtitles]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  In a downtrodden South American oil tow
 n\, four desperate men sign on for a suicide mission: driving trucks pack
 ed with nitroglycerin over makeshift roads and treacherous mountain terra
 in. The men are forced to navigate fires\, bumps\, and jolts\, while thei
 r fortitude and friendship are put to the ultimate test: keep cool or die
 . <i>The Wages of Fear</i> is\, hands down\, one of the greatest thriller
 s of all time and a white-knuckle ride from Clouzot\, France's legendary 
 master of suspense. [152 min\; suspense\, thriller\; French with English 
 subtitles]</p>
