  chance to solve their problems by accepting a job that pays $10\,000 and
  will grant them legal citizenship. The catch? They have to stay alive wh
 ile ferrying a shipment of highly unstable nitroglycerin across 200 miles
  of bad roads\, unstable bridges\, and unpredictable attacks from local g
 angs. [121 min\; thriller\, suspense\; English and Spanish with English s
 ubtitles]The screening will be followed by a discussion of stunt work in 
 film between Leraldo Anzaldua and Patrick Kelly.
