SUMMARY:Pillion | Q+
DESCRIPTION:Colin (Harry Melling)\, a timid man looking for love in his s
 mall town\, is swept off his feet when enigmatic\, impossibly handsome bi
 ker Ray (Alexander Skarsgård) takes him on as his submissive. Adapted fr
 om the 2020 novel Box Hill by Adam Mars-Jones\, Pillion is\, at its core\
 , a classic romantic comedy with a thoroughly modern relationship at its 
 center. Winner of the Best Screenplay prize and the Palm Dog for Mutt Mom
 ent (shout out Hippo and Rosie!) at the 2025 Cannes Film Festival. [106 m
 in\; comedy\, romance\; English]
